        "node_id": "n_1_f48ba8",
        "thought_text": "Thought-1 (revised): Ensure the loop iterates up to `min(K, N) + 1` to correctly handle cases where `K` equals `N`. Additionally, use dynamic programming to efficiently compute combinations under modulo \\(10^6 + 7\\).",
        "parent_revision_path_hash": "5740354900026072187",
