        "node_id": "n_5_df35a6",
        "thought_text": "Ensure the inner loop iterates from `min(K, i * M)` down to `max(0, i - 1)` to correctly handle cases where `i` is greater than `K`. This adjustment ensures that the loop does not access out-of-bounds indices in the `dp` array.",
